sequenceDiagram
  participant VM as CloudSyncViewModel
  participant Room as Cloud outbox DAO
  participant Worker as WorkManager recovery
  participant Firebase as Realtime Database
  VM->>Room: enqueue operation transactionally
  VM->>Firebase: attempt delivery
  alt acknowledged
    Firebase-->>VM: success
    VM->>Room: mark delivered
  else offline or rejected
    Firebase-->>VM: error
    VM->>Room: keep pending and record attempt
    Worker->>Room: load pending operations
    Worker->>Firebase: retry when constraints allow
  end
